      "description": "A scene depicting two conjoined twins seated side-by-side at a press conference, surrounded by microphones from various media outlets. The twins appear serious or weary, and the image is framed to emphasize their physical connection and the media attention they are receiving. The overlaid text 'being conjoined isn't easy' adds a sarcastic or mocking tone to the scene.",
