      "instance_name": "ableist_humor",
      "label": "Ableist Humor",
      "description": "The meme uses sarcasm to trivialize the physical and emotional challenges faced by conjoined twins, reducing their lived experience to a joke. This is a form of ableist humor that mocks a medical condition and diminishes the dignity of those who live with it.",
