      "description": "The overlaid text 'being conjoined isn't easy' is presented in a sarcastic tone, implying that the condition is trivial or burdensome, which mocks the physical and emotional challenges faced by conjoined twins. This sarcastic expression is intended to elicit humor at the expense of their lived experience.",
