      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme trivializes the lived experience of conjoined twins by presenting the text 'being conjoined isn't easy' in a sarcastic tone, reducing a complex medical condition to a joke. This can be seen as ableist humor that diminishes the dignity of those who live with such conditions and potentially causes harm to the community of conjoined twins or those who identify with their experience.",
